2. Using the For-Loop print even numbers like 2,4,6,8 till 20.

public class EvenNum {

	public static void main(String[] args) {
		

		for( int i=1;i<=20;i++) {
			
			if(i%2==0)
			System.out.println("print the even number values:"+i);
			
			
			
		}
	}

}
